---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About — Tin Le"
  description="About Tin Le, a full-stack software engineer working with C#, .NET, and Angular."
>
  <h1
    slot="header-title"
    class="page-title animate-fade-in-up text-4xl"
    style="animation-delay: 0.1s"
  >
    about
  </h1>
  <article class="prose prose-zinc mt-6 max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
    <p>
      I'm Tin, a full-stack software engineer based mainly in Ho Chi Minh City (but always open to Remote work). 
      I spend most of my time in the .NET world &mdash; building web applications with .NET and Angular, modernizing
      legacy code bases, and wiring up CI/CD pipelines in Azure.
    </p>

    <p>
      I graduated Summa Cum Laude from Southeast Missouri State University with a B.S. in Computer
      Science and a minor in Mathematics, finishing with a 3.94 GPA (4.0 in-major) as a Regent's
      Scholarship recipient. Since then I've worked as a Full Stack Developer delivering production
      full-stack features end to end across fintech (Netwealth), aviation (American Airlines), and
      public-sector (MWRA) environments.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside of work I tinker on side projects like Smeexer, and small Python tools. 
      I enjoy the whole stack: designing an API, 
      shaping the frontend that consumes it, and making sure both ship reliably through good pipelines.
    </p>

    <h2>Currently</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Working daily with .NET 10, Angular 22, TypeScript, Azure, and SSMS</li>
      <li>Building a personal blog with Astro, Tailwind, and Markdown</li>
      <li>Learning Go and exploring web development using agents</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Base>
